WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Two primitive TPMS blocks start at the same center height. The slot is stationary on the left; the tenon is forward and to the right. This is an Isaac Sim kinematic concept.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The tenon lifts straight up above the slot block.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The raised tenon transfers toward its partner, keeping its bottom clear.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The mating features pause above the vertical groove.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The tenon lowers vertically into its nominal neighboring position. Horizontal position remains fixed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The pair holds the nominal seated pose. Geometry is unchanged; manufacturing clearance and physical contact are not validated.
